      "summary": ": Wednesday / Rāapa Sun is shining, the lifts are spinning, the Summit and Motatapu Chutes are open! The refreshements are flowing. What a day! Winter is delivering the goods with fantastic snow conditions across the mountain and plenty of fun turns waiting to be found. We have a fine day ahead. The Grooming team have served up beautiful runs to kick-start your day. Off piste you will still find soft wind-blown deposits and chalky snow tucked into all the right places, making for some enjoyable skiing and riding. As always after a windy spell, keep an eye out for wind-stripped ridges up high. Bullet has been added to the groomed runs menu out in The Saddle. Motatapu Chutes and Hollywood Bowl are now open! Wrap up warm or check out the great layers available from The Motatapu Store. -- Sundance - closed",
